  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub002_middlem_01",
      "hash": "d4a497ff6d047846",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大叔「小弟弟，有件好事情\\n我只跟你一個說……！\\c\\n秘密的寶可夢鯉魚王，\\n只賣你₽500！\\r\\n怎麼樣，要買嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub002_middlem_02",
      "hash": "d4a496ff6d047693",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大叔「小妹妹，有件好事情\\n我只跟妳一個說……！\\c\\n秘密的寶可夢鯉魚王，\\n只賣妳₽500！\\r\\n怎麼樣，要買嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub002_sys_01",
      "hash": "6ca6dbe7418fb0b1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]用₽500\\n買了鯉魚王！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub002_middlem_03",
      "hash": "d4a495ff6d0474e0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳不要嗎？\\n那真是太遺憾了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_middlem1_01_p04_r004_r0101",
      "hash": "dedc7688dd7cf84d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub002_middlem_04",
      "hash": "d4a49cff6d0480c5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的錢好像不太夠呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub002_middlem_05",
      "hash": "d4a49bff6d047f12",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大叔「對了對了，\\n我這裡可不接受退貨啊。"
    }
  ],
